    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d654">

                <pb facs="0626" n="1360" xml:id="pg1360"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mavroyeni Bey to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Imperial Legation of Turkey</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-12-02"><hi rendition="#italic">December 2,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary of State</hi>: I hasten to send your
                    excellency copy of a telegram I have this instant received from the Sublime
                    Porte: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>The American missionaries enjoy throughout the Empire the greatest
                            protection. Sufficient troops are detailed to guard them in order to
                            shelter them from the attacks of the Armenian rioters. Those
                            missionaries have themselves expressed to the Imperial authorities their
                            gratitude for the protection accorded.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>Be pleased, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mavroyeni.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
